        "content": "### {{CLINIC_NAME}} - Visit Completion & Workflow Orchestration (PET WF3)\n\n**🎯 Purpose:** Automatically handles post-visit processes when a pet appointment is completed\n\n**🚀 Triggers:**\n• Manual webhook: {{VISIT_COMPLETE_WEBHOOK_PATH}}\n• Auto-detection via Google Calendar when events end\n\n**⚡ Automated Actions:**\n• Updates appointment status to \"Completed\"\n• Sends completion SMS to pet owner\n• Triggers 4 downstream workflows:\n  - 🧾 WF5: Invoicing System\n  - 📋 WF6: Medical Records Update\n  - ⭐ WF7: Review Request System\n  - 🔄 WF8: Customer Retention Engine\n\n**📊 Integration:**\n• Appointments Sheet: {{APPOINTMENTS_SHEET_ID}}\n• Master Hub: {{MASTER_APPOINTMENTS_SHEET_ID}}\n• Calendar: {{GOOGLE_CALENDAR_ID}}\n\n**⚙️ Configuration:**\n• Clinic: {{CLINIC_NAME}}\n• Timezone: {{TIMEZONE}}\n• Poll Mode: {{CALENDAR_POLL_MODE}}\n\n**🔗 Inter-Workflow Dependencies:**\n• Client-specific workflow IDs are dynamically resolved during deployment\n• Each client gets personalized workflow references",
